  "qatarImportOptionsHelpTitle": "Import Qatar options",
  "qatarImportOptionsHelpBody": "Default position controls how the \"Self\" crew member is assigned during import.\n\nSIC: Self is imported as SIC. Names from the PIC column are imported as PIC crew members.\n\nPIC: Self is matched from PIC names using Pilot Name.\nPilot Name is required when Default position is PIC and must match the workbook text.\n- If only your name is present in PIC names, Self is imported as PIC.\n- If your name is missing, or appears together with other PIC names, Self is imported as Relief Captain and the other names are imported as PIC crew members.",
