  "southwestImportOptionsHelpTitle": "Import Southwest options",
  "southwestImportOptionsHelpBody": "Crew Function: sets your own role for imported Southwest flights (PIC or SIC).\n\nRecalculate block time: uses departure/arrival timestamps to compute block.\nCalculate night time: computes night minutes from departure/arrival and route.\nCalculate IFR time: computes IFR from block using IFR %, Minus, and Minimum.\nIFR %: percentage applied to block minutes.\nMinus: minutes subtracted before the percentage is applied.\nMinimum: minimum IFR minutes enforced after percentage/subtraction.\nCalculate cross-country: computes cross-country minutes from distance.\nCross-country threshold (NM): minimum distance required to count as cross-country.\n\nOverwrite existing data: updates matching flights already in the database.\nAdd copilot staff number: appends copilot staff number to notes when available.\nAdd flight number to notes: appends the Southwest flight number to notes.",
